extends /specs/products/pericles/page-structure/structure/templates/structure/layout-tmpl.jade

block content

    h1 Go to section

    .source_info
        markdown
            p Go to section functionality links between link "href anchor" and its related content section that's having an id value equal to the href value .
            p We have it two ways
            ul
                li 1. Scrolling the page with animation to the related content section
                li 2. Displaying the content inside a popup "footNotePopup"

            small note: it also works with accordion, it will open the target wrapper "accordion__content" and scroll to the section

    section.source_section
        h2 Scrolling behavior
        markdown
            p Use HTMl Classes to control the animated scroll functionality


        h3 scrollableLink

        markdown
            p Adding `scrollableLink` class to any anchor element will make these anchors evaluate the animated scroll functionality.
            p <a href="/specs/products/pericles/templates/article/?clarify=true&tpl=clear&sections=1.3" target="_blank"> example</a>

        code.src-html.source_visible.source_example
            | <a href='#section-id' class='scrollableLink'> GO TO SECTION </a>
            | <div id="section-id"></div>


        h3 scrollableLinks

        markdown
            p Adding `scrollableLinks` class to any element anchors wrapper will make these anchors evaluate the animated scroll functionality.

        code.src-html.source_visible.source_example
            | <div class="scrollableLinks">
            |   <a href="#section-id"></a>
            | </div>
            | <div id="section-id"></div>


        h3 go to section block "special case" used in toc page

        markdown
            p Adding `data-db-target-of='sections'` attribute to any element anchors wrapper will make these anchors evaluate the animated scroll functionality.
            p <a href="/specs/products/pericles/templates/toc?clarify=true&tpl=clear&sections=1.1" target="_blank"> example</a>


        code.src-html.source_visible.source_example
            | <a href='#' data-db-target-for='sections' data-db-switch='icon-close_thin' title='Go To Sections'> GO TO SECTION </a>
            | <div id="sections">
            |   <a href="#section-id"></a>
            | </div>
            | <div id="section-id"></div>

    section.source_section
        h2 footNotePopup behavior
        markdown
            p Use HTMl Classes to control the popup functionality

        markdown
            p Adding `noteLink scrollableLink` classes to any anchor element to have the popup functionality

        code.src-html.source_visible.source_example
            | <a href='#note-id' class='noteLink scrollableLink'> note </a>
            | <div id="note-id"></div>


        .source_example
            a.noteLink.scrollableLink(title='Link to note', href='#note-0002', target='_self') click on me
            div#note-0002
                | Tariff Rate Quotas: Quantities inside a quota are charged lower import duty rates,
                | Tariff Rate Quotas: Quantities inside a quota are charged lower import duty rates,
                | Tariff Rate Quotas: Quantities inside a quota are charged lower import duty rates,
                | than those outside.


    | #{''}